            "message": "The calculation for this metric involves obtaining the current \"stock in hand\" for each warehouse within the selected district, as obtained from the stock reconciliation page in the inventory management system. The daily bed nets microplan target is then obtained from the project setup data, and the total number of bed nets needed is calculated as the product of the daily target and the total number of warehouses in the district. ",
