            "locale": "en_MZ"
        },
        {
            "code": "DSS_CALCULATION_OVERVIEW_POPULATION_COVERAGE_CUMULATIVE_ONE",
            "message": "This metric measures the percentage of the population that has been covered with the intervention (in this case, the distribution of bed nets) against the microplan target. The microplan target refers to the number of individuals that were targeted to receive the intervention according to the project setup.",
