            "locale": "en_MZ"
        },
        {
            "code": "DSS_CALCULATION_OVERVIEW_POPULATION_COVERAGE_CUMULATIVE_THREE",
            "message": "Additionally, an insight is available to show the percentage change in population coverage from the previous day. This can provide an indication of how quickly the population coverage is increasing or decreasing compared to the previous day.",
            "module": "rainmaker-hcm-dss",
            "locale": "en_MZ"
        },
        {
            "code": "DSS_CALCULATION_OVERVIEW_POPULATION_COVERAGE_CUMULATIVE_TWO",
            "message": "The calculation takes the sum of the population covered (based on the quantity of bed nets distributed) for the selected province, district, or corresponding district (depending on the user role) since the start of the campaign, and then divides it by the population microplan target for that area. This quotient is then multiplied by 100 to get a percentage.",
